    Timeout: 30.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M\n--- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.70\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000\n\nTimeout after 7601 updates (1809s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.000\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.000\nTraining time: 1821s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M\n--- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | -1.20\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000\n\nTimeout after 8901 updates (1823s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.000\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.000\nTraining time: 1835s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training\
