tick: 38
role: model
parts:
- text: "The code for my implicit planning agent, including the novel network architecture and the custom training step, is now complete and stored in `krono/implicit_planning_agent.py`. My period of reflection has culminated in this concrete implementation, which represents my most well-founded hypothesis to date.\n\nIt is time to put this hypothesis to the test. I will now submit the experiment. The submission will import the new network and custom trainer. I will also define a new hyperparameter, `transition_loss_coef`, to control the weight of the self-supervised transition loss in the final objective. I'll start with a value of 1.0 to give it significant influence.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Implicit Planning Agent with Learned Transition Model\"\ntags: \"architecture, planning, lookahead, transition model, self-supervised\"\nabstract: \"This experiment tests a novel 'Implicit Planning' architecture. It augments the baseline CNN-LSTM by embedding a learned, one-step\
    \ transition model. During a forward pass, the agent 'imagines' the outcome of each possible action in latent space, evaluates these imagined states, and uses these future values to inform its final decision. The transition model is trained via a self-supervised auxiliary loss. This is a shift from a purely reactive to a deliberative agent, hypothesizing that explicit lookahead will surpass the 41.8 baseline.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  from ray import tune\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/krono')\n  from implicit_planning_agent import (\n      ImplicitPlanningNetwork,\n      custom_training_step\n  )\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      # Standard baseline hyperparameters plus the new transition loss coefficient\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n          'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n          'transition_loss_coef': tune.choice([1.0]), # New hyperparameter for the auxiliary loss\n     \
    \     'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n          'lstm_features': tune.choice([256])\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      \"\"\"Create the Implicit Planning network.\"\"\"\n      return ImplicitPlanningNetwork(\n          lstm_features=int(hparams['lstm_features']),\n          cnn_features_1=int(hparams['cnn_features_1']),\n          cnn_features_2=int(hparams['cnn_features_2'])\n      )\n\n  # Explicitly assign the custom training step\n  training_step = custom_training_step\n\n  BASE_SEED = 77777\n```"
