    , line 38, in predict_step\n    imagined_z = self.transition_model(carry_zt, action)\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/bd8a79f0-8680-411d-88c1-b1a00512bdb4/storage/krono/implicit_planning_v2.py\", line 29, in transition_model\n    z_a = jnp.concatenate([z, a_broadcast], axis=-1)\n          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/numpy/lax_numpy.py\", line 4648, in concatenate\n    arrays_out = [lax.concatenate(arrays_out[i:i+k], axis)\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/numpy/lax_numpy.py\", line 4648, in <listcomp>\n    arrays_out = [lax.concatenate(arrays_out[i:i+k], axis)\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: Cannot concatenate arrays with shapes that differ\
    \ in dimensions other than the one being concatenated: concatenating along dimension 3 for shapes (4, 8, 8, 64), (4, 32, 8, 1).\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write krono/reward_shaping.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: krono/reward_shaping.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 78 | 1 | Implicit Planning v2 (Corrected\
    \ Prototype) | Krono I | 43 | n.a. |\n| 76 | 1 | Implicit Planning Agent v2 (Simplified Prototype) | Krono I | 42 | n.a. |\n| 74 | 1 | Implicit Planning Agent (Bugfix v1) | Krono I | 40 | n.a. |\n| 70 | 1 | Implicit Planning Agent with Learned Transition Model | Krono I | 38 | n.a. |\n| 61 | 1 | Spatially-Aware Attention (Concatenative Positional Embeddings) | Krono I | 33 | 7.50 |\n| 59 | 1 | Spatially-Aware Attention with Positional Embeddings | Krono I | 32 | 12.00 |\n| 54 | 1 | CNN-LSTM with Pre-LSTM Skip Connection | Krono I | 30 | 39.60 |\n| 49 | 1 | Architecture Study: CNN + GRU | Krono I | 28 | 39.90 |\n| 45 | 1 | Wide CNN-LSTM (512 Features) | Krono I | 27 | 41.40 |\n| 42 | 1 | Ablation Study: Simple CNN + LSTM | Krono I | 25 | 21.30 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n\
    ---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
