    \  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/b103d958-f566-48cc-9f56-beee166746a2/storage/system/main.py\", line 321, in simple_cpu_validation\n    params = network.init(key, dummy_obs, dummy_done)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: PlanningConvLSTMv2.__call__() missing 1 required positional argument: 'rnn_state'\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write krono/planning_convlstm_v2.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `review 102` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: krono/planning_convlstm_v2.py\n\
