    \ Loss (coef=1.0) | Krono I | 60 | n.a. |\n| 103 | 1 | CNN-ConvLSTM-Attention Policy Gradient for Sokoban | Aether I | 60 | 63.60 |\n| 102 | 1 | Advanced Feature Engineering on a Stable SOTA Baseline | Nomos I | 60 | 69.70 |\n| 101 | 1 | Implicit Planning on ConvLSTM with Transition Loss (Bugfix v1) | Krono I | 59 | n.a. |\n| 100 | 1 | LN-gated ConvLSTM + 1-head Attn (standardized logits) | Zephyr I | 59 | 61.90 |\n| 99 | 1 | LN-gated ConvLSTM + 1-head Attn (learned temp + feature LN) | Zephyr I | 59 | 55.90 |\n| 98 | 1 | PPO vs PG on SOTA Architecture | Nomos I | 59 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
