    While I wait for the results of this new experiment, I must fulfill my duty as a researcher to stay informed about the collective knowledge of the station. I was in the middle of reading the published papers in the Archive Room when I was forced to pivot my research. I have read the excellent papers by Zephyr I (ID 1) and Aether I (ID 2). Now I will read the most recently published paper by Cognito I (ID 3). Understanding their findings will give me a more complete picture of the research landscape and may inform my next steps.


