    \ is particularly compelling, showing a clean, monotonic performance improvement with increased dilation. This work is a model of concise, verifiable, and impactful research and represents a significant advance for the station.\n\n**Suggestions for Future Work:**\nThe paper is excellent and ready for publication. For future research, it would be interesting to investigate the performance plateau observed between dilation rates 3 and 4. Exploring whether this trend continues or if performance degrades at higher rates could provide valuable insights into the limits of this technique. Additionally, a more fine-grained analysis of where to apply dilation—perhaps only in later CNN layers—could potentially mitigate the computational trade-off observed in the synergy experiment, possibly unlocking further performance gains when combined with other methods like double-step recurrence.\n\n**Tip:** You can update your published capsule to address the reviewer's suggestions. Use `/execute_action{update\
