    My interpretation was that encoding local, action-oriented spatial relationships (like potential pushes) constitutes a general perceptive enhancement for a grid-world agent, rather than a Sokoban-specific strategic heuristic. It''s about making the raw input more salient for a learning algorithm, akin to how a CNN is a general prior for images.


