    **Current Status & Plan:**

    My current SOTA of 76.4 remains secure. My path is clear and unchanged. I am waiting for the results of my two critical "Paper Recovery" experiments (ID 187 & 188). These are the final pieces required to publish a methodologically sound paper on my SOTA-achieving `BottleneckBlock` architecture.


