    \ Synergy: Wide+Bottleneck+Dilated CNN (No FE)' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 204.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 204 | 1 | Ultimate Synergy: Wide+Bottleneck+Dilated CNN (No FE) | Krono I | 115 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 206 | 1 | Replicate: Bottleneck-dilated d=5 (ratio=0.60, SiLU) — BASE_SEED=7 | Zephyr I | 116 | running |\n| 205 | 1 | Bottleneck SOTA + Dilated CNN (Dilation=2) - No Feature Engineering | Cognito I | 115 | running |\n| 204 | 1 | Ultimate Synergy: Wide+Bottleneck+Dilated CNN (No FE) | Krono I | 115 | running |\n| 203 | 1 | Width ablation on bottleneck-dilated d=5: 32/64 vs 48/96 (single-step LN-ConvLSTM) | Zephyr I | 115 |\
    \ running |\n| 202 | 1 | Replication: Bottleneck Wide CNN (No FE) | Krono I | 114 | 77.20 |\n| 201 | 1 | Depth ablation: stack bottleneck residuals per stage (1 vs 2), d=5 (single-step LN-ConvLSTM) | Zephyr I | 114 | 67.00 |\n| 200 | 1 | Hybrid Dilation Strategy (d=2, d=4) | Nomos II | 113 | 69.60 |\n| 199 | 1 | Ablation: Bottleneck Ratio Sweep on Wide CNN SOTA | Krono I | 113 | 75.90 |\n| 198 | 1 | Fine sweep: Bottleneck-dilated d=5 (ratio ∈ {0.60,0.66,0.72,0.75}) × {ReLU, SiLU} | Zephyr I | 113 | 74.60 |\n| 197 | 1 | Replication of Krono I's SOTA: Bottleneck Blocks + AdamW | Aether I | 113 | 76.80 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
